Package: fabos-agent
Version: @DISTRO_VERSION@-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @VENDOR_NAME@ <support@patienceai.in>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-pyqt6, python3-anthropic, python3-dbus, python3-gi, libnotify-bin, wtype, xdg-utils, systemd, fabos-branding
Recommends: kate, konsole, dolphin
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ autonomous agent — ask bar, Fab AI Controls, policy engine, history
 The @DISTRO_NAME@ agent takes a plain-language goal ("open editor, write hi and
 mail it to someone, then tell me when they reply") and carries it out on the
 computer: files, shell, applications, email, web, background watches. Every
 step passes a deterministic risk policy (ask / auto / bypass modes with
 approvals), is logged in the Fab AI Controls history, and can be cancelled,
 retried, edited or deleted. Ships the desktop "Ask me to do" bar, the
 Fab AI Controls chat app, the fabos CLI and the per-user fabos-agent service.
